OL,3,GNEWSA'Significant' settlement for
OL,4,Afamily of ex-navy man killed by British
OL,5,Aarmy
OL,6,
OL,7,FA "significant payment" has been made
OL,8,Fto the daughter of a former Royal Navy
OL,9,Fserviceman who was killed by the
OL,10,FBritish army in Belfast 54 years ago.
OL,12,FThe Ministry of Defence (MoD) has
OL,13,Fsettled the civil action brought by the
OL,14,Ffamily of Thomas Burns, a father of
OL,15,Ffour who was shot in the chest as he
OL,16,Fwas leaving the Glenpark Social Club.
OL,18,FHe had served in the navy for over
OL,19,Feight years before he returned home to
OL,20,Flive with his family in Belfast in
OL,21,F1965.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
