OL,3,GNEWSA'Significant' settlement for
OL,4,Afamily of ex-navy man killed by British
OL,5,Aarmy
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn MoD spokesperson confirmed it had
OL,8,Fsettled a claim brought on his behalf
OL,9,Fand said it was "glad to have been able
OL,10,Fto do so given Mr Burns' past service
OL,11,Fin the armed forces."
